{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47300","headline":"览古十四首 十三 · 吴筠","name":"览古十四首 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄元明知止，大雅尚保躬。\n茂先洽闻者，幽赜咸该通。\n弱年赋鹪鹩，可谓达养蒙。\n晚节希鸾鹄，长飞戾曾穹。\n知进不知退，遂令其道穷。\n伊昔辨福初，胡爲迷祸终。\n方验嘉遁客，永贞天壤同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}